prompt:
Data JSON dari API bertipe `unknown[]`. Lengkapi type guard `isUser(value: unknown): value is User` sehingga `validUserNames` hanya mengambil nama user yang valid.

Sebuah nilai dianggap `User` jika:
- berupa objek biasa: bukan `null` dan bukan array;
- `name` bertipe `string` dan tidak kosong setelah di-`trim()`;
- `age` bertipe `number`, bilangan bulat, dan `>= 0`;
- `email` (opsional) jika ada dan bukan `undefined`, harus bertipe `string` (`null` **tidak** valid).

Contoh: `[{ name: "Ana", age: 30 }, { name: "Budi", age: "30" }, null]` → `["Ana"]`.

data.starter:
interface User {
  name: string;
  age: number;
  email?: string;
}

function isUser(value: unknown): value is User {
  // tulis kodemu di sini
  return false;
}

function validUserNames(items: unknown[]): string[] {
  return items.filter(isUser).map((u) => u.name);
}

referenceSolution:
interface User {
  name: string;
  age: number;
  email?: string;
}

function isUser(value: unknown): value is User {
  if (typeof value !== "object" || value === null || Array.isArray(value)) return false;
  const v = value as Record<string, unknown>;
  if (typeof v.name !== "string" || v.name.trim() === "") return false;
  if (typeof v.age !== "number" || !Number.isInteger(v.age) || v.age < 0) return false;
  if (v.email !== undefined && typeof v.email !== "string") return false;
  return true;
}

function validUserNames(items: unknown[]): string[] {
  return items.filter(isUser).map((u) => u.name);
}

